url: https://github.com/FAIR-bioHeaders/gff3-validator
abstract: >-
  A one-stop validator for GFF3 annotation files. It checks files against the
  GFF3 specification (version 1.26) and the Sequence Ontology, explains each
  problem with a numbered rule, the line and a suggested fix, and optionally
  checks the FAIR-bioHeaders (FHGFF3) provenance header. Pre-release; the rule
  catalogue is under review with the Sequence Ontology group.
